WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.351
In tutorial 9.7, you'll add easy
listings, and keep old links working.

00:00:12.361 --> 00:00:15.751
First, on Link building,
click Listings to add.

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:20.201
Links you can add yourself lists
directories where buyers, and AI assistants,

00:00:20.251 --> 00:00:22.218
look for businesses like yours.

00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:26.217
Each one shows its status
and why it's worth it.

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:28.809
Competitors there shows
who's already listed.

00:00:30.188 --> 00:00:34.188
Click Open submission page, and
add your business on their site.

00:00:34.238 --> 00:00:35.894
Nothing is submitted for you.

00:00:37.213 --> 00:00:40.863
Then click I've submitted, or
I'm listed if you already are.

00:00:40.913 --> 00:00:44.906
Every week, your listing is checked,
and marked linked once it's live.

00:00:45.925 --> 00:00:49.470
Not worth it for you? Click
Not relevant. Under linked,

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:53.318
you see where you're already listed,
and click Show again to bring one back.

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:58.653
Next, Redirects to add lists old
addresses of yours that now fail,

00:00:58.703 --> 00:01:00.966
each with the live page
it should point to.

00:01:02.299 --> 00:01:05.474
Click Copy the list, and
send it to your developer.

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:08.816
A redirect keeps the value of
the links to the old address.

00:01:10.349 --> 00:01:14.474
Finally, What your links did shows
how each won link moved its page,

00:01:14.524 --> 00:01:16.240
compared with your other pages.

00:01:17.807 --> 00:01:21.807
Easy links you add yourself, and
old addresses that keep their value,

00:01:21.857 --> 00:01:23.314
all in one checklist.

00:01:24.286 --> 00:01:28.236
Good to know: Can't check automatically
means the site blocks checks,

00:01:28.286 --> 00:01:30.287
so look for your listing there yourself.

00:01:31.286 --> 00:01:35.361
So, open the listings checklist,
submit to the ones worth being on,

00:01:35.411 --> 00:01:38.187
copy the redirects, and
see what your links did.

00:01:39.211 --> 00:01:43.646
Next, read your weekly link-building
report, in tutorial 9.8.
